Zero point energy                ...      0.24490733 Eh     153.68 kcal/mol
Thermal vibrational correction   ...      0.00543391 Eh       3.41 kcal/mol
Thermal rotational correction    ...      0.00141627 Eh       0.89 kcal/mol
